---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="About">
  <div class="container prose">
    <p class="eyebrow">About Solenopsis</p>
    <h1>Salesforce tools, kept focused.</h1>
    <p>Solenopsis is an open-source collection of tools for Salesforce developers. The original project grew from a need for better command-line deployment tooling and expanded into supporting libraries for Salesforce APIs, sessions, metadata, and logging.</p>
    <h2>Source first</h2>
    <p>The GitHub repositories are the source of truth for the individual projects. This site is the front door: a small, durable map of the project family and its history.</p>
    <h2>Find the code</h2>
    <p><a href="https://github.com/solenopsis">github.com/solenopsis</a> contains the organization repositories, including the core Solenopsis tooling, SOAP, Session, Metadata, and SLoggly projects.</p>
  </div>
</Layout>
